<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - British Telecom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - British Telecom raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Monday it had raised its rating for British Telecommunications Plc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The company has proposed a merger with MCI Communications Corp worth about $20 billion depending on the value of the British Telecom buyback.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
